{"3420410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "进化岛：Jinhuadao", "steam_appid": 3420410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/42d2d53c1ea473ecc3b9111b901b30bb.poster.avif?t=1775748381\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/42d2d53c1ea473ecc3b9111b901b30bb.webm?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/42d2d53c1ea473ecc3b9111b901b30bb.mp4?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在人工智能数据冲刷，大量的数码碎片充斥在数据宇宙当中，渐渐形成了进化岛，我们是误入这片领域的契约者，意外获得了奇异兽。进化岛需要一名契约者成为这个世界的领袖，带领所有奇异兽，进化数码宇宙，建立全新的进化岛。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一款3D卡牌的动物合成游戏，与其他动物战斗胜利后可以获得奇异蛋，孵化完成获得奇异动物。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >目前上线的野兽包括：虎、狼、霸王龙、独角兽、浣熊、熊猫、鳄鱼、骆驼、狮、象、豹、驴、牦牛、狍、蛇、山羊、梅花鹿、狐、猪、鹰、猴子、猩猩、鸡、鹦鹉、天鹅、蜘蛛、蜈蚣、蜗牛、乌龟、青蛙、鲨鱼、甲龙、蛟龙、麒麟、三角龙、九头蛇、飞龙、鲲、章鱼、天使、猫、恶魔、骷髅、机械、史莱姆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1、合成动物基本规律：玩家所选择的宠物，与击败的宠物的基因，生成新的奇异蛋。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2、元素：不同元素具有不同的效果，将影响游戏中战斗的方式。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3、宠物技能修改为三种：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >陆地技能：查看同种族玩家位置。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >飞行技能：技能释放阶段可以在天空飞行</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >水中技能：可以在水中移动</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/535498679a18a39d4d3b3fe221ac4fde.poster.avif?t=1775748381\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/535498679a18a39d4d3b3fe221ac4fde.webm?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/535498679a18a39d4d3b3fe221ac4fde.mp4?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4、战败其他宠物则会升级，根据宠物的各项成长属性，获得不程度的成长。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/9e32205d73897a7d4301554a66dbe649.poster.avif?t=1775748381\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/9e32205d73897a7d4301554a66dbe649.webm?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/9e32205d73897a7d4301554a66dbe649.mp4?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5、融合：根据出战宠物与需要融合的宠物属性，生成新的宠物。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/d069a77e9c24e0d349c9f7494e240da5.poster.avif?t=1775748381\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/d069a77e9c24e0d349c9f7494e240da5.webm?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/d069a77e9c24e0d349c9f7494e240da5.mp4?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6、阵亡：当您拥有其他宠物时，阵亡可以选择新宠物出战，如您没有其他宠物，则会在世界中重生。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7、孵化：奇异蛋的孵化时间会随着您的拥有的宠物数量不断提升。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8、开启奇异蛋：孵化时间未结束之前，不要拾取奇异蛋，会导致孵化失败。在孵化奇异蛋期间，可能会被其他玩家抢夺奇异蛋，或被其他玩家干扰拾取奇异蛋，注意使用强大的宠物保护奇异蛋。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/7de1a68c9960f4cea0cd74ca517dc181.poster.avif?t=1775748381\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/7de1a68c9960f4cea0cd74ca517dc181.webm?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/7de1a68c9960f4cea0cd74ca517dc181.mp4?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9、奇异蛋的产生：无论战败AI或战败其他玩家，都会出现奇异蛋，根据战败对象的动物，决定奇异蛋的基因。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10、召唤古神：寻找召唤神，将奇异蛋神化，根据神化数量，将产生不同程度的古神降临，战败古神，获得奖励。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/84ce8ffeaff30bb4a383c0c56dd4126a.poster.avif?t=1775748381\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/84ce8ffeaff30bb4a383c0c56dd4126a.webm?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/84ce8ffeaff30bb4a383c0c56dd4126a.mp4?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11、进化岛是一座在天空漂浮的岛，偶尔会经过一些漂浮的小岛，只有使用飞行宠才能到达。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12、主岛只会出现常见的野兽，其他类型的野兽只有其他小岛上才会出现。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13、小岛由同种族野兽占据，且存在该种族神使，可以通过神使召唤该种族古神挑战。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14、浮空岛不同时间进入，会出现不同的生物，获得稀缺宠物。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15、当玩家的宠物达到100级以后，带领小伙伴寻找浮空岛开启诸神之战，战败所有强大的古神后，完成蜕变；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16、玩家完成1阶蜕变以后，在召唤之地，开启神王之战，战败神王完成2阶蜕变。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17、拍卖行是通过碎星进行宠物间的交换的。 <br>18、优质的宠物可以通过拍卖行与其他玩家交易。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19、进化：已经开通进化的合成兽在特定条件下可以完成进化。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/5446d5340d4227aa7c943b4ee32690a8.poster.avif?t=1775748381\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/5446d5340d4227aa7c943b4ee32690a8.webm?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/5446d5340d4227aa7c943b4ee32690a8.mp4?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20、强化：获得不同的强化数据，可以在不同阶段为宠物强化。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/67656216f4126c4b175dc400a35b11c6.poster.avif?t=1775748381\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/67656216f4126c4b175dc400a35b11c6.webm?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/67656216f4126c4b175dc400a35b11c6.mp4?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21、您的屏幕会出现被病毒破坏的情况，修复会获得数码碎片，在名片界面可以查看数码碎片数量，点击数码碎片可以获得进化线索。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22、获得数码碎片的同时，有可能获得强化片段，点击时有概率提升强化片段，不同的强化片段可以在不同的进化阶段强化宠物。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23、增加传送门，可以通过传送门快速进入其他区域。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24、宠物图鉴</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/f57090237b340f4ccd7dc706a2549ede.poster.avif?t=1775748381\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/f57090237b340f4ccd7dc706a2549ede.webm?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/f57090237b340f4ccd7dc706a2549ede.mp4?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >基本操作如下：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1、WSAD：控制移动</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2、长按鼠标右键，点击鼠标左键，显示或隐藏鼠标。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3、一些功能可以通过快捷键操作呼出，也可以通过鼠标点击功能按钮。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4、回车键：聊天以及发送聊天。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5、查看聊天记录，发送聊天旁边的展开按钮。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6、E键：提示拾取、召唤古神时使用。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7、Q键：种族技能键。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8、C键：打开和关闭个人资料界面</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9、B键：打开和关闭背包界面</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10、M键：切换地图显示</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11、攻击：点击鼠标左键或长按鼠标左键连续攻击。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12、空格：跳跃、飞起</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13、退出游戏：ALT+F4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >请注意：游戏目前没有国外服务器，由于服务器连接问题，仅支持中国地区游玩，玩家可选择使用加速器或VPN游玩，或后续根据玩家反应，我们会增加其他国家的服务器来解决该问题，为您带来的不便敬请谅解，感谢您的关注。</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/42d2d53c1ea473ecc3b9111b901b30bb.poster.avif?t=1775748381\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/42d2d53c1ea473ecc3b9111b901b30bb.webm?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/42d2d53c1ea473ecc3b9111b901b30bb.mp4?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在人工智能数据冲刷，大量的数码碎片充斥在数据宇宙当中，渐渐形成了进化岛，我们是误入这片领域的契约者，意外获得了奇异兽。进化岛需要一名契约者成为这个世界的领袖，带领所有奇异兽，进化数码宇宙，建立全新的进化岛。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一款3D卡牌的动物合成游戏，与其他动物战斗胜利后可以获得奇异蛋，孵化完成获得奇异动物。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >目前上线的野兽包括：虎、狼、霸王龙、独角兽、浣熊、熊猫、鳄鱼、骆驼、狮、象、豹、驴、牦牛、狍、蛇、山羊、梅花鹿、狐、猪、鹰、猴子、猩猩、鸡、鹦鹉、天鹅、蜘蛛、蜈蚣、蜗牛、乌龟、青蛙、鲨鱼、甲龙、蛟龙、麒麟、三角龙、九头蛇、飞龙、鲲、章鱼、天使、猫、恶魔、骷髅、机械、史莱姆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1、合成动物基本规律：玩家所选择的宠物，与击败的宠物的基因，生成新的奇异蛋。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2、元素：不同元素具有不同的效果，将影响游戏中战斗的方式。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3、宠物技能修改为三种：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >陆地技能：查看同种族玩家位置。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >飞行技能：技能释放阶段可以在天空飞行</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >水中技能：可以在水中移动</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/535498679a18a39d4d3b3fe221ac4fde.poster.avif?t=1775748381\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/535498679a18a39d4d3b3fe221ac4fde.webm?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/535498679a18a39d4d3b3fe221ac4fde.mp4?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4、战败其他宠物则会升级，根据宠物的各项成长属性，获得不程度的成长。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/9e32205d73897a7d4301554a66dbe649.poster.avif?t=1775748381\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/9e32205d73897a7d4301554a66dbe649.webm?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/9e32205d73897a7d4301554a66dbe649.mp4?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5、融合：根据出战宠物与需要融合的宠物属性，生成新的宠物。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/d069a77e9c24e0d349c9f7494e240da5.poster.avif?t=1775748381\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/d069a77e9c24e0d349c9f7494e240da5.webm?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/d069a77e9c24e0d349c9f7494e240da5.mp4?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6、阵亡：当您拥有其他宠物时，阵亡可以选择新宠物出战，如您没有其他宠物，则会在世界中重生。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7、孵化：奇异蛋的孵化时间会随着您的拥有的宠物数量不断提升。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8、开启奇异蛋：孵化时间未结束之前，不要拾取奇异蛋，会导致孵化失败。在孵化奇异蛋期间，可能会被其他玩家抢夺奇异蛋，或被其他玩家干扰拾取奇异蛋，注意使用强大的宠物保护奇异蛋。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/7de1a68c9960f4cea0cd74ca517dc181.poster.avif?t=1775748381\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/7de1a68c9960f4cea0cd74ca517dc181.webm?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/7de1a68c9960f4cea0cd74ca517dc181.mp4?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9、奇异蛋的产生：无论战败AI或战败其他玩家，都会出现奇异蛋，根据战败对象的动物，决定奇异蛋的基因。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10、召唤古神：寻找召唤神，将奇异蛋神化，根据神化数量，将产生不同程度的古神降临，战败古神，获得奖励。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/84ce8ffeaff30bb4a383c0c56dd4126a.poster.avif?t=1775748381\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/84ce8ffeaff30bb4a383c0c56dd4126a.webm?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/84ce8ffeaff30bb4a383c0c56dd4126a.mp4?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11、进化岛是一座在天空漂浮的岛，偶尔会经过一些漂浮的小岛，只有使用飞行宠才能到达。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12、主岛只会出现常见的野兽，其他类型的野兽只有其他小岛上才会出现。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13、小岛由同种族野兽占据，且存在该种族神使，可以通过神使召唤该种族古神挑战。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14、浮空岛不同时间进入，会出现不同的生物，获得稀缺宠物。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15、当玩家的宠物达到100级以后，带领小伙伴寻找浮空岛开启诸神之战，战败所有强大的古神后，完成蜕变；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16、玩家完成1阶蜕变以后，在召唤之地，开启神王之战，战败神王完成2阶蜕变。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17、拍卖行是通过碎星进行宠物间的交换的。 <br>18、优质的宠物可以通过拍卖行与其他玩家交易。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19、进化：已经开通进化的合成兽在特定条件下可以完成进化。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/5446d5340d4227aa7c943b4ee32690a8.poster.avif?t=1775748381\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/5446d5340d4227aa7c943b4ee32690a8.webm?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/5446d5340d4227aa7c943b4ee32690a8.mp4?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20、强化：获得不同的强化数据，可以在不同阶段为宠物强化。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/67656216f4126c4b175dc400a35b11c6.poster.avif?t=1775748381\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/67656216f4126c4b175dc400a35b11c6.webm?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/67656216f4126c4b175dc400a35b11c6.mp4?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21、您的屏幕会出现被病毒破坏的情况，修复会获得数码碎片，在名片界面可以查看数码碎片数量，点击数码碎片可以获得进化线索。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22、获得数码碎片的同时，有可能获得强化片段，点击时有概率提升强化片段，不同的强化片段可以在不同的进化阶段强化宠物。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23、增加传送门，可以通过传送门快速进入其他区域。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24、宠物图鉴</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/f57090237b340f4ccd7dc706a2549ede.poster.avif?t=1775748381\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/f57090237b340f4ccd7dc706a2549ede.webm?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/extras/f57090237b340f4ccd7dc706a2549ede.mp4?t=1775748381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >基本操作如下：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1、WSAD：控制移动</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2、长按鼠标右键，点击鼠标左键，显示或隐藏鼠标。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3、一些功能可以通过快捷键操作呼出，也可以通过鼠标点击功能按钮。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4、回车键：聊天以及发送聊天。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5、查看聊天记录，发送聊天旁边的展开按钮。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6、E键：提示拾取、召唤古神时使用。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7、Q键：种族技能键。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8、C键：打开和关闭个人资料界面</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9、B键：打开和关闭背包界面</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10、M键：切换地图显示</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11、攻击：点击鼠标左键或长按鼠标左键连续攻击。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12、空格：跳跃、飞起</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13、退出游戏：ALT+F4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >请注意：游戏目前没有国外服务器，由于服务器连接问题，仅支持中国地区游玩，玩家可选择使用加速器或VPN游玩，或后续根据玩家反应，我们会增加其他国家的服务器来解决该问题，为您带来的不便敬请谅解，感谢您的关注。</p>", "short_description": "一款3D卡牌动物合成游戏，战斗胜利后获得奇异蛋，孵化获得奇异动物。 合成规律：玩家所选择的宠物，与击败的宠物，生成奇异蛋。 元素：不同元素不同效果，将影响游戏战斗方式。 升级：根据宠物成长属性，获得成长。 融合：根据宠物与需要融合宠物，生成新的宠物。 阵亡：拥有其他宠物阵亡，选择新宠物，如没有其他宠物，则会重生。 孵化：奇异蛋孵化时间与宠物数量有关。 开启奇异蛋：孵化未结束，不要拾取，会失败。孵化期间，其他玩家会抢夺奇异蛋，注意保护。 奇异蛋产生：战败宠物，出现奇异蛋，根据战败动物，决定奇异蛋类型。 召唤古神：寻找召唤神，神化，根据神化数量，古神降临，战败古神，获得奖励。 诸神之战、神王之战", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/header.jpg?t=1775748381", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/ff04f802e4fcb1028b9e79d58b6c9aeeca270dca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775748381", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420410/ff04f802e4fcb1028b9e79d58b6c9aeeca270dca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775748381", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> win7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I3 2.6GHz以上<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA 960 以上<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> win 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I5 3.0GHz以上<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA 1060 以上<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["古德模型", "goodmoxing"], "publishers": ["古德模型"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1699, "final": 1699, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$16.99"}, "packages": [1209674], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy 进化岛：Jinhuadao", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option